        "original_id": "2bf47fca-80a4-5a6f-a74f-d999da8c0c64",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Xavier Malisse, Gene Mayer, Ruben Bemelmans, Jamie Delgado, Ken Skupski\n- Events: 2012 Farmers Classic – Doubles\n- Topics: Tennis, professional careers, doubles title defense\n\nFacts:\n- Gene Mayer was born on April 11, 1956, and is a former tennis player from the United States.\n- Gene Mayer won 14 singles titles during his tennis career.\n- Xavier Malisse was born on July 19, 1980, and is a Belgian retired professional tennis player.\n- At the 2012 Farmers Classic – Doubles, Xavier Malisse and fellow Belgian Ruben Bemelmans defended Malisse's title.\n- In the final of the 2012 Farmers Classic – Doubles, Xavier Malisse and Ruben Bemelmans defeated Jamie Delgado and Ken Skupski 7–6, 4–6, [10–7].",
